      "title": "Two issuers, one proxy",
      "items": [
        "Each Dex serves its own TLS discovery endpoint and one static user",
        "One AuthenticationConfiguration lists both issuers",
        "readinessRequireAllIssuers: true, so Ready means both JWKS fetched"
      ]
